{"text":"At the Apple Summit, 100% of the executives spent 100% of their presentations talking about how to help teachers teach and how to help students learn. One was obsessed with their competition, the other one was obsessed with where they're going. So at the end of my presentation at Microsoft, they gave me a gift. They gave me the new Zune, which was the competitor to the iPod Touch when it was a thing, right? And I have to tell you, this piece of technology was spectacular. It was beautiful. The user interface was incredible. The design was amazing. It was intuitive. It was one of the most beautiful, elegant pieces of technology I'd ever seen, right? No, it didn't work with iTunes, which is an entirely different problem. I couldn't use it. But that's something else.","words":[{"text":"At","start":0.8,"end":1.26},{"text":"the","start":1.26,"end":1.38},{"text":"Apple","start":1.38,"end":1.66},{"text":"Summit","start":1.66,"end":2.02,"punct":","},{"text":"100%","start":2.66,"end":3.4},{"text":"of","start":3.4,"end":3.54},{"text":"the","start":3.54,"end":3.62},{"text":"executives","start":3.62,"end":4.08},{"text":"spent","start":4.08,"end":4.76},{"text":"100%","start":4.76,"end":5.48},{"text":"of","start":5.48,"end":5.6},{"text":"their","start":5.6,"end":5.72},{"text":"presentations","start":5.72,"end":6.3},{"text":"talking","start":6.3,"end":7.0},{"text":"about","start":7.0,"end":7.34},{"text":"how","start":7.34,"end":7.7},{"text":"to","start":7.7,"end":7.82},{"text":"help","start":7.82,"end":7.96},{"text":"teachers","start":7.96,"end":8.28},{"text":"teach","start":8.28,"end":8.5},{"text":"and","start":8.5,"end":8.66},{"text":"how","start":8.66,"end":8.78},{"text":"to","start":8.78,"end":8.86},{"text":"help","start":8.86,"end":8.98},{"text":"students","start":8.98,"end":9.28},{"text":"learn","start":9.28,"end":9.58,"punct":"."},{"text":"One","start":10.72,"end":11.02},{"text":"was","start":11.02,"end":11.24},{"text":"obsessed","start":11.24,"end":11.68},{"text":